      "body": "Wipro announced that it has appointed Nagendra Bandaru as the CEO of its newly created artificial intelligence segment. Bandaru will head the unit that will develop agentic AI solutions and create new AI-led business streams. The company also announced the resignation of Suzanne Dann, CEO of its \"Americas2\" unit. Accenture veteran Kanwar Singh has ?been brought in to fill Bandaru's current role of president and managing partner of technology services business line.",
